OL,3,GNEWSAAsbestos removal work in Mersey
OL,4,Atunnel set to take two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major road tunnel faces at least two
OL,7,Fyears of maintenance work under plans
OL,8,Fworth an estimated #4.6m.
OL,10,FThe programme to remove asbestos from
OL,11,Fthe Kingsway Tunnel is expected to
OL,12,Fbegin in January 2027.
OL,14,FAbout 8,000 asbestos panels weighing
OL,15,Faround 500 tonnes would be removed,
OL,16,Falong with associated fixtures and
OL,17,Fcables, before the structure is cleaned
OL,18,Fand decontaminated.
OL,20,FMost of the work would be carried out
OL,21,Fduring planned overnight closures.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
